#: ../../source/docs/common-NarinFC-H7.rst:210
#: 19fc1c3724c34894947796aefedbc299 367fdcd7910e455aa68475f4ba2b784d
#: 36fe451ae59c44f7aceba6592902dbf6 8cdb57212cba4fb2864030d77ead90de
#: a5cbb061bd11440282a3aeee2ab20b40 f0aec01e59664cae98de23613cd806d7
msgid ""
"The board has two dedicated power monitor ports on 6 pin connectors, one for"
" an analog monitor and one for a DroneCAN monitor. The correct battery "
"setting parameters are dependent on the type of power brick which is "
"connected. By default, use of a DroneCAN battery monitor is enabled by "
"default as the first battery monitor."
msgstr ""
"该飞控板在 6 针接头上有两个专用电源监测接口，一个用于模拟监测，另一个用于 DroneCAN "
"监测。正确的电池参数设置取决于所连接的电源模块类型。默认情况下，DroneCAN 电池监测被启用为第一电池监测器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-NarinFC-H7.rst:213
#: 2ec54c888090465ca0674753e658fbb7 85b56bd7b1ca4a4eb4712662581f69ee
