"This board comes with ArduPilot firmware pre-installed and other "
"vehicle/revision ArduPilot firmware can be loaded using most Ground Control "
"Stations."
msgstr "该飞控板预装了 ArduPilot 固件，其他飞行器类型/版本的 ArduPilot 固件可使用大多数地面控制站加载。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-NarinFC-H7.rst:229
#: 4fbb36f07c684771a432c6cef79bea22 5499f28e1e6d4cccbf97e6a28ae6ab96
#: 5b7345f4d90a4fa9966a453106c66d9d 6cfbc39f31ed4e1a871167716c7e8c05
#: bdde24e41b03409c99bad922a8a1af5d df146aa8b8634a93bb6fe3f4d298b462
msgid ""
"Firmware for these boards can be found here `https://firmware.ardupilot.org "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ in sub-folders labeled “NarinFC-H7”."
msgstr ""
"该飞控板的固件可在 `https://firmware.ardupilot.org <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_"
" 的「NarinFC-H7」子文件夹中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-NarinFC-H7.rst:231
#: 112bbf175d74424dada56f2e146ab56e 31377847838e482ea53a472adf406777
#: 4b14e1b473e242c7b823d643b04c03c3 68346748db374c968732059e337b11b9
