msgid ""
"The board comes pre-installed with an ArduPilot bootloader, allowing the "
"loading of \\*.apj firmware files with any ArduPilot compatible ground "
"station, such as Mission Planner."
msgstr ""
"该飞控板预装了 ArduPilot 引导程序，可使用任何 ArduPilot 兼容地面站（如 Mission Planner）加载 \\*.apj "
"固件文件。"

